The following is my termcap for the ALS Smarterm II 80-column card
for the Apple II.  It seems to work with both vi and rogue (th acid test).
Please let me know if you have difficulties with it.  The description
supports most ofthe features of the card including cursor movement
(gotoxy).
__________________________________

# Bill's Experimental Apple II
#	Termcap Description  06/25/83
#	Uses ^J for keyboard down, ^_ for keyboard up.
#	These choices may be changed at the user's convenience.
#	100 ms delays have been put in after ff, cr, nl to avoid
#	possible loss of characters.

qst|qsmarterm|Apple with ALS Smarterm II:\
	:co#80:li#24:bs:am:nd=\034:up=^_:ce=^]:cd=^K:ho=^Y:kh=^Y:\
	:so=^O:se=^N:kl=^H:kr=^U:ku=^_:kd=^J:cl=^L:do=^J:\
	:al=^E:bt=^R:bw:dl=^F:sf=^W:sr=^V:cm=^^%r%+ %+ :\
	:dF=100:dC=100:dN=100:

#
